identified in Hatifect project files, resolved NuGet assets, manifests, and the
release allowlist as of the inventory date. Third-party components are governed
by their own terms, not by the Hatifect Personal Use License.

The current Hatifect binary release allowlist contains only Hatifect assemblies,
manifests, configuration, localization, and the Hatifect license. The NuGet
